  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NZzxdkrV4s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6d9796c521a3261b9a7e4c3eb6b1c3d2dfe4c112.png\" alt=\"「LopyMine 的專案」Discord 伺服器連結\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particle-effects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e867d37a2f6ad224258b75aacf6477e777427717.png\" alt=\"CurseForge 連結橫幅\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LopyMine/particle-effects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae65154a7b076cd508f14975a27d1e75e3449a1d.png\" alt=\"Github 連結橫幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-effects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b9c43eaea7fc523285ae0981829b84e206672b48.png\" alt=\"Modrinth 連結橫幅\"></a></p><h2>💬 描述</h2><p>Particle Effects 是一款簡潔的視覺效果用戶端模組，為 Minecraft 原版中的每種效果添加了獨特的紋理粒子！同時也支援多人遊玩 ^^</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LopyMine/Particle-Effects/refs/heads/master/img/banner.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><h2>✨ 粒子</h2><p>以下是每種效果對應的所有獨特粒子：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5cdc6c81fab76bc0e8b4892579da994787cde48e.jpeg\" alt=\"效果展示\"></p><h2>🌟 資源包</h2><p>還有一些資源包能稍微改變原始模組中粒子的外觀。</p><p>1) <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fparticles-updated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particles Updated 作者：zed1ker</a></p><p>2) <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fparticle-effects-updated-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Updated Particles 作者：Timofeii7547</a></p><p>3) <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbarebones-x-particle-effects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones x Particle Effects 作者：Dezert3</a></p>",
